WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.520
and I ate something that made my tummy

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.899
hurt and then I got really scared

00:00:03.899 --> 00:00:05.339
because you weren't there to rub my

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:08.099
tummy and then and then I was so scared

00:00:08.099 --> 00:00:10.080
that I just couldn't hold it anymore and

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.559
and

00:00:13.559 --> 00:00:15.719
will you forgive me

00:00:15.719 --> 00:00:28.380
I didn't do it on purpose I swear

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:33.380
please don't hallucinize me
